## Goal
- Please, format "?" and "&" as {{constant}}.

## Input
- Please, format "Line 1:" and "Line 2:" in <<bold>>.
- Please, format the third line as <<Next [[N]] lines:>>.
- Please, format "baseUrl", "N", "key" and "value" as [[variable]].

## Constraints
- Please, format "N", "baseUrl", "key" and "value" as [[variable]].

As a web dev I love this contribution :D.
Btw, you can use URLSearchParams in JavaScript to solve this :D

let [url, N] = [readline(), +readline()];
const params = new URLSearchParams();
for (let i = 0; i < N; i++) {
  const [key, val] = readline().split(" ");
  params.append(key, val);
}
if (N > 0) url += `?${params.toString()}`;
console.log(url);
